        "nobel_worthiness": "A fundamental new classification of electronic matter, joined rapidly to decisive transport experiments and a major continuing field.",
        "attribution": "Kane and Mele supplied the quantum-spin-Hall theory; Molenkamp led a landmark experimental realization. The nominated set nevertheless omits other consequential experimental contributors.",
        "maturity": "The topological-insulator and quantum-spin-Hall phenomenology is extensively replicated, quantitatively understood, and technologically influential.",
