        "Stuart S. P. Parkin",
        "Terunobu Miyazaki"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Room-temperature tunnel magnetoresistance coupled a clear quantum spin-transport phenomenon to transformational magnetic-memory technology.",
        "attribution": "Moodera, Miyazaki, and Parkin made major experimental and technological contributions, but the MgO-barrier advance involved several important groups.",
        "maturity": "The physics is robust and its application in magnetic tunnel junctions is mature at industrial scale.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The citation combines early room-temperature TMR with later giant MgO TMR, complicating a three-person attribution."
        ]
      }
    },
