        "nobel_worthiness": "Magnetic skyrmions revealed topological spin textures as experimentally accessible particles with emergent electrodynamics and unusual device prospects.",
        "attribution": "Pfleiderer and Tokura are highly visible experimental leaders, though the underlying theoretical prediction and wider experimental discovery record need fuller attribution review.",
        "maturity": "Skyrmion phases, imaging, and transport signatures are independently established in numerous magnetic systems.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "It remains uncertain whether one can isolate a sufficiently sharp discovery citation from the broader skyrmion literature."
        ]
      }
